1
00:04:41,052 --> 00:04:47,052
The average person uses 10% of their brain capacity.
Imagine what she could do with 100%.

2
00:09:22,105 --> 00:09:28,105
Lucy is a action, science fiction film directed by Luc Besson.

3
00:14:03,157 --> 00:14:09,157
A woman, accidentally caught in a dark deal, turns the tables on her captors and
transforms into a merciless warrior evolved beyond human logic.

4
00:18:44,210 --> 00:18:50,210
Lucy, played by Scarlett Johansson.

5
00:23:25,263 --> 00:23:31,263
Professor Norman, played by Morgan Freeman.

6
00:28:06,315 --> 00:28:12,315
Mr. Jang, played by Choi Min-sik.

7
00:32:47,368 --> 00:32:53,368
Pierre Del Rio, played by Amr Waked.

8
00:37:28,421 --> 00:37:34,421
The Limey, played by Julian Rhind-Tutt.

9
00:42:09,473 --> 00:42:15,473
Richard, played by Pilou Asbæk.

10
00:46:50,526 --> 00:46:56,526
Lucy is a 2014 English-language French science fiction action film written and directed by Luc
Besson for his company EuropaCorp, and produced by his wife, Virginie Besson-Silla.

11
00:51:31,578 --> 00:51:37,578
It was shot in Taipei, Paris, and New York City.

12
00:56:12,631 --> 00:56:18,631
It stars Scarlett Johansson, Morgan Freeman, Choi Min-sik, and Amr Waked.

13
01:00:53,684 --> 01:00:59,684
Johansson portrays Lucy, a woman who gains psychokinetic abilities when a
nootropic, psychedelic drug is absorbed into her bloodstream.

14
01:05:34,736 --> 01:05:40,736
The film was released on 25 July 2014 and became a massive box office success, grossing over
$469 million worldwide, more than eleven times the budget of $40 million.

15
01:10:15,789 --> 01:10:21,789
It received generally positive, but also polarized, critical reviews.

16
01:14:56,842 --> 01:15:02,842
Although praise was given for its themes, visuals, and Johansson's performance, many critics found the plot
nonsensical, especially its focus on the ten-percent-of-the-brain myth and resulting abilities.

17
01:19:37,894 --> 01:19:43,894
The film explores themes of artificial intelligence (a.i.),
telepathy, intelligence, drug mule, time travel.

18
01:24:18,947 --> 01:24:24,947
The tone is dark and thought_provoking and intense.
